---
description: Rules specific to the mastery/decay/spaced-repetition engine
globs:
  - "src/lib/scoring/**"
  - "src/lib/scheduler/**"
alwaysApply: false
---
- This logic must be pure functions, unit-testable in isolation from DB/UI.
- Every scoring function needs a docstring stating its inputs, decay assumption, and one worked numeric example.
- Write unit tests in the same PR as the function — do not defer.
- Do not change SM-2-style scheduling constants without flagging it as a decision.